<!--
  Meta (Facebook) SDK credentials, read by the meta-data entries in
  AndroidManifest.xml. Both values are public by design — they ship inside
  every APK — so they are committed, like the Stripe publishable key.

  Where they come from: developers.facebook.com -> your app
    - App ID          : Paramètres > Général > Identifiant de l'app
    - Client token    : Paramètres > Avancé > Jeton client
  Keep them in sync with ios/Runner/Info.plist — `make check-facebook`, which
  every release target runs, fails if either file is still on a placeholder.
-->
